      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this era of evidence based medicine information about diet and diseases is less certain than information about drugs and diseases. Drug treatment is less complex. Dietary change can't usually be incorporated in a double blind trial. There is much more funding for pharmaceutical trials than for dietary trials. The following notes concentrate on newer, developing concepts."},
